.vercel/


.vercel
.env*
helmian-admin/

# The starter slash commands under .helmion/commands/ are product content,
# not a local workspace: they ship inside the admin function's bundle
# (see the includeFiles glob in vercel.json), so they are tracked even
# though the repo root ignores .helmion/ directories.
!.helmion/
!.helmion/commands/
!.helmion/commands/*.md
